WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:08.170
Put viewings, meetings and calls on the calendar and tick off your tasks as you go.

2
00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:14.170
The calendar shows the viewings, meetings, calls and tasks of the whole leasing team.

3
00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:19.960
Today is highlighted. Each entry is coloured by type and opens its lead.

4
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.170
Move between months, or show only your own entries.

5
00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:28.360
To book a viewing, use Schedule. Choose Viewing.

6
00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:33.690
Choose the lead, so the viewing appears on its timeline too.

7
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:37.810
Give it a clear title.

8
00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:42.420
Set the day and time, and who will host it.

9
00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:51.810
Add it. The office opens the lead, with the viewing waiting on its timeline.

10
00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:58.600
It is on the calendar too, and the host gets a reminder before it starts.

11
00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:04.390
Tasks lists what is overdue, due today and coming up.

12
00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:08.230
When something is done, tick it off here.
